🛣️ Roadmap for Daylio – Your Day Organized
Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1–4)
Define core features: mood tracking, daily journal, task organizer.

Sketch wireframes for Home, Journal, Calendar, Insights.

Choose tech stack (Flutter/React Native + Firebase/Supabase).

Build MVP (basic mood + note tracker with calendar view).

Phase 2: Core Development (Weeks 5–10)
Add task management (create, edit, complete tasks).

Implement reminders/notifications.

Build mood + productivity charts.

Integrate authentication (Google/Microsoft login).

Phase 3: Beta Launch (Weeks 11–14)
Release beta to small group of testers.

Collect feedback on usability + design.

Fix bugs, polish UI/UX.

Add dark mode + logo branding.

Phase 4: Growth Features (Weeks 15–20)
Habit tracking (daily streaks).

Export/share insights (PDF or social media).

Cloud sync across devices.

Gamification (badges for consistency).

Phase 5: Launch & Marketing (Weeks 21–24)
Publish on Google Play + App Store.

Use tagline: “DOWNLOAD DAYLIO TODAY, YOUR DAY ORGANIZED”.

Run social media campaigns (Instagram, TikTok, Twitter).

Partner with productivity/mindfulness influencers.

Phase 6: Scale & Monetize (Months 6–12)
Premium features: advanced analytics, custom themes, unlimited entries.

Subscription model (monthly/yearly).

Expand to web app version.

Continuous updates based on user feedback.
